MindCode resolves each provider credential environment-first, then from
the on-disk secret store (~/.config/mindcode/credentials.json).

The built-in VEXZY profile uses the VEXZY_API_KEY environment variable:
  export VEXZY_API_KEY="forge-…"

Custom providers store their key in the secret store instead; manage
providers and keys with `mindcode provider` and `mindcode settings key`.

The legacy OAuth setup flow is not used by MindCode.
